        "headline": "屏東縣府與長榮航空邀德國業者踩線 為拓展歐洲觀光市場鋪路",
        "summary": "屏東縣府與長榮航空邀請德國慕尼黑的戶外運動及特色旅遊業者赴屏東六天五夜踩線，體驗山林探索、生態賞鳥、海洋運動及原住民族行程。縣府表示，此次合作串聯國際航線與地方觀光資源，並盼將景點、導覽及戶外活動轉為符合歐洲需求的旅遊商品，為拓展市場奠基。",
        "headline_en": "Pingtung County Government and EVA Air Invite German Operators on a Scouting Visit to Lay Groundwork for European Tourism Growth",
        "summary_en": "Pingtung County Government and EVA Air invited outdoor-sports and specialty-tourism operators from Munich, Germany, on a six-day, five-night scouting visit to Pingtung. The itinerary included mountain exploration, ecological birdwatching, marine sports and Indigenous experiences. The county said the cooperation links international air routes with local tourism resources; site visits and exchanges are intended to help develop products suited to European demand and lay groundwork for market expansion.",
